@base_url_local = http://localhost:5140
@base_url_azure = https://gis-landslide-detection-eegmbphwg2gdgrfn.switzerlandnorth-01.azurewebsites.net

### 1. Test Locale (In esecuzione su porta 5140)
GET {{base_url_local}}/api/Landslide?lat=43.0805&lng=13.2384
Accept: application/json

### 2. Test su Azure (Dati Reali Online)
GET {{base_url_azure}}/api/Landslide?lat=43.0805&lng=13.2384
Accept: application/json

### 3. Test Coordinate diverse (Gran Sasso)
GET {{base_url_azure}}/api/Landslide?lat=42.4430&lng=13.5670
Accept: application/json

### ==========================================
### TEST ENDPOINT GIS (LOCAL DOCKER POSTGIS)
### ==========================================

### 4. Recupera tutti i Punti (GeoJSON)
GET {{base_url_local}}/api/GisData/points
Accept: application/json

### 5. Filtra i Punti per Tipo (Ristoranti)
GET {{base_url_local}}/api/GisData/points?type=Restaurant
Accept: application/json

### 6. Recupera tutte le Linee (Fiumi/Strade in GeoJSON)
GET {{base_url_local}}/api/GisData/lines
Accept: application/json

### 7. Recupera i Poligoni dei Comuni (GeoJSON)
GET {{base_url_local}}/api/GisData/polygons
Accept: application/json

### 8. Ricerca Spaziale: Trova i 2 punti più vicini a lat/lng
GET {{base_url_local}}/api/GisData/nearest?lat=43.1&lng=13.4&limit=2
Accept: application/json

### 9. Routing Dijkstra: Calcola il tragitto stradale più breve
GET {{base_url_local}}/api/GisData/route?startLat=43.1&startLng=13.4&endLat=43.2&endLng=13.5
Accept: application/json

### 10. CRUD: Aggiungi un nuovo Punto Ristorante
POST {{base_url_local}}/api/GisData/points
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Trattoria da Paolo",
  "type": "Restaurant",
  "lat": 43.115,
  "lng": 13.405
}

### 11. Spatial Query: Trova i punti dentro un'area poligonale
POST {{base_url_local}}/api/GisData/points/within
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "SearchArea",
  "coordinates": [
    [13.38, 43.07],
    [13.46, 43.07],
    [13.46, 43.16],
    [13.38, 43.16],
    [13.38, 43.07]
  ]
}

